flowchart LR
  classDef device fill:#F3E8FF,stroke:#6A1794,stroke-width:2,color:#211A25
  classDef sensor fill:#E7F8F8,stroke:#00A7B5,stroke-width:2,color:#211A25
  classDef app fill:#FCE7F3,stroke:#B8005E,stroke-width:2,color:#211A25
  classDef cloud fill:#EEF2FF,stroke:#4655A8,stroke-width:2,color:#211A25
  classDef safety fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#D98A00,stroke-width:2,color:#211A25
  classDef note fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#CBD5E1,stroke-dasharray: 4 4,color:#475569

  subgraph W[SheShield wearable]
    S1[MPU6050\nMotion / impact]:::sensor
    S2[MAX30102\nOptical signal]:::sensor
    S3[SOS button\nManual trigger]:::safety
    S4[GPS module\nOutdoor location]:::sensor
    MCU[ESP32\nACDDF state machine]:::device
    FB[Vibration + buzzer\nWarning feedback]:::safety
    GSM[SIM800L\nSMS fallback]:::device
    PWR[Protected 1S LiPo\nRegulated rails]:::device
    S1 --> MCU
    S2 --> MCU
    S3 --> MCU
    S4 --> MCU
    MCU --> FB
    MCU --> GSM
    PWR --> MCU
    PWR --> GSM
  end

  MCU -->|Bluetooth event\nNormal / Monitor / Warning / Alert / Resolved| PHONE
  subgraph P[Companion smartphone]
    PHONE[SheShield app\nDashboard + status]:::app
    LOC[Phone location\nFreshness indicator]:::app
    CONTACT[Trusted contacts\nVerified recipients]:::app
    EVID[Optional evidence\nOff by default]:::app
    PHONE --> LOC
    PHONE --> CONTACT
    PHONE --> EVID
  end

  CONTACT -->|Push / SMS gateway| NOTIFY[Notification delivery\nDelivery status]:::cloud
  GSM -->|Where compatible| NOTIFY
  PHONE --> LOG[Local event history\nAudit trail]:::cloud
  PHONE -.-> NOTE[The prototype separates\ndetection, location, delivery\nand evidence status.]:::note
